<a href="#S4.T2" title="In 4.3 Downstream Transfer ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ RATS! Patches Talk Through Registers:Emergent Parts in Register Attention Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 2</span></a>.
